WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.714
Feather was flying over the meadow.

2
00:00:08.715 --> 00:00:14.247
It was a beautiful spring day.

3
00:00:14.248 --> 00:00:22.252
The meadow was bright green.

4
00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:28.206
She flew down to take a closer look.

5
00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:31.882
Feather saw a big patch of clovers.

6
00:00:31.883 --> 00:00:39.333
"Yuck! So many clovers!" she thought.

7
00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:44.370
Suddenly she spotted two girls.

8
00:00:44.371 --> 00:00:49.199
Feather hid in the grass and watched them.

9
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.792
One girl bent down and plucked something.

10
00:00:52.793 --> 00:00:55.899
"Look, Maggie!" she said.

11
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.849
"I found a clover with four leaves!"

12
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.395
Feather gulped.

13
00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:07.315
"Four-leaf clovers help people see fairies," she thought.

14
00:01:07.316 --> 00:01:11.683
"Those girls are fairy hunters!"

15
00:01:11.684 --> 00:01:14.129
Maggie shook her head.

16
00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.577
"That's not a four-leaf clover, Emma.

17
00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:22.191
It's just another three-leaf clover."

18
00:01:22.192 --> 00:01:27.007
Emma sighed. "Oh well.

19
00:01:27.008 --> 00:01:30.367
Maybe I'll find one soon."

20
00:01:30.368 --> 00:01:35.579
Maggie nodded. "Let's go to your house.

21
00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:41.995
It's time for the party!"

22
00:01:41.996 --> 00:01:48.561
Feather stayed low until the girls left.

23
00:01:48.562 --> 00:01:53.798
"I have to warn the other fairies!" she thought.

24
00:01:53.799 --> 00:01:59.826
She zoomed back to the grove.

25
00:01:59.827 --> 00:02:09.091
"Danger!" Feather cried. "Fairy hunters!"

26
00:02:09.092 --> 00:02:13.068
"Where?" Bumble asked.

27
00:02:13.069 --> 00:02:17.207
"I saw two of them in the meadow!" Feather said.

28
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.660
Sprite flew over.

29
00:02:19.661 --> 00:02:24.284
"How do you know they're fairy hunters?" she asked.

30
00:02:24.285 --> 00:02:32.567
"The girls were looking for four-leaf clovers," Feather said.

31
00:02:32.568 --> 00:02:39.893
Sprite laughed. "Humans like clovers, Feather.

32
00:02:39.894 --> 00:02:43.820
They think four-leaf clovers bring good luck."

33
00:02:43.821 --> 00:02:49.714
She did a flip. "You worry too much!"

34
00:02:49.715 --> 00:02:52.496
Then she zipped off.

35
00:02:52.497 --> 00:02:57.470
Feather frowned. "Sprite doesn't know everything.

36
00:02:57.471 --> 00:03:00.713
I'm sure those girls are fairy hunters.

37
00:03:00.714 --> 00:03:04.323
Bumble, you believe me, right?"

38
00:03:04.324 --> 00:03:11.350
"Um . . ." Bumble looked away. "Oh! Look!"

39
00:03:11.351 --> 00:03:14.820
Wish smoke was drifting into Fairy Grove.

40
00:03:14.821 --> 00:03:17.446
Hob read the wish aloud.

41
00:03:17.447 --> 00:03:21.195
"Emma wants a four-leaf clover."

42
00:03:21.196 --> 00:03:26.628
Feather gasped. "We can't grant that wish!"

43
00:03:26.629 --> 00:03:30.097
"Why not?" Sprite asked.

44
00:03:30.098 --> 00:03:33.735
"Emma was in the meadow!" Feather said.

45
00:03:33.736 --> 00:03:38.313
"She's a dangerous fairy hunter!"

